Actually, I can tell you, I don't work anymore because it's more a pleasure than a job waking up every morning.
That said, I want to tell you wich steps are needed to achieve your goals.
Firs dot: dreams.
The law of attraction always works.
If you use it to achieve something you don't like, you will create it.
It works much better
with the things you want. Sure you need a lot of energy; and we must never doubt what we believe in, what we’re looking for, otherwise we will go nowhere.
Believing, then.
We use to say: first I see, then I can believe.
Here it's the opposite.
In life you really believe first
