A dream that normally opens new doors, so I can face new possibilities: how can one look at someonee's life?
How will I consider the next situation?
And so waking up, for me, means getting on the move, choosing the new path to take today.
To orient oneself, to orient oneself towards the new, not on the same old road.
So look for a bit where a new door opens up, and what new goal it leads me to.
And that also means deciding, among the many possibilities brought about by a new day - after a good night's sleep, of course.
Open the doors, open up to new ideas, and open up to the world.
Open up to creativity: that's a bit of my life purpose.
Also, it's not just about me: because I can do almost anything, I can be creative.
