Well, it is not 'as if'; you are still there, whenever you bring it back to your mind.
It is so incredibly true because it is true!
At least for your brain.
Yes, because brain doesn't distinguish between reality and imagination.
Let me explain it: whether you live an experience for real, or you simply imagine it, remember it, that's the same thing for your brain.
And as a consequence, it reacts in the same way.
I'll give you a demonstration. look here!
