My friend Marco has been able to do it five years ago.
But that's not exactly the case.
I am talking about dynamical code learning
from manuals, the Internet and experts in any field.
I don’t want to scare you. There are things that AI will never have: charisma, leadership.
We will never be able to love our job, so we'll never transmit that love to the things we do.
Anyone who loves his or her own job will never ever be replaced by Artificial Intelligence.
I’m going to answer your latest question now: I am your reflex.
The reflex of a kid who created a world in order to catch the attention of his father, and never succeeded.
