And they also lock the wardrobe.
The moment my spineless husband gets hired at Apple, we but this nerdy house with a garden, and instead of apples we put a nice barbecue, you will see!"
Then you already know the rest of the story.
Apple recruits no more.
(Laughter) The owner of the garden saw the bar tree and cast them out.
As you can imagine, from there on, the story of humanity is the story of our unsatisfaction and the yearning for change.
